WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:09.957
Week 27: Present Subjunctive: Will and Emotion. recommend and request action express reaction state necessity without overclaiming certainty

2
00:00:09.957 --> 00:00:24.161
Operational objective. By the end of this section you can recommend and request action, express reaction, state necessity without overclaiming certainty. The focus is useful performance, not isolated terminology.

3
00:00:24.161 --> 00:00:33.009
Language system. Present subjunctive formation; noun clauses after will, influence, recommendation, necessity, and emotion.

4
00:00:33.009 --> 00:00:39.040
Sound and delivery. Subjunctive endings and clear subject changes across que.

5
00:00:39.040 --> 00:00:48.210
Core principle. Notice meaning first, then form. Retrieve the new language aloud, compare it with the model, and repair one feature at a time.

6
00:00:48.210 --> 00:01:15.471
Model language. Recomiendo que revise los datos. — I recommend that you review the data. Es necesario que participen los vecinos. — It is necessary for the residents to participate. Me alegra que estés aquí. — I am glad you are here. El director pide que lleguemos temprano. — The director asks us to arrive early. Ojalá encuentren una solución justa. — I hope they find a fair solution.

7
00:01:15.471 --> 00:01:25.219
Check your readiness. Explain the core idea. Produce an original example. Complete the section assessment at 85% or higher.
